---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <header class="border-b border-stone-200 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur sticky top-0 z-30">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <h1 id="shop-name" class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Xưởng Thủ Công</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500">Chế tác thủ công &amp; nhận làm theo yêu cầu riêng</p>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full max-w-xs">
        <input
          id="search-input"
          type="search"
          placeholder="Tìm sản phẩm, chất liệu..."
          class="w-full px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-cream/60 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-clay-600"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 flex-1 w-full">
    <div
      id="demo-banner"
      class="hidden mb-6 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-900 text-sm"
    >
      Đang hiển thị <strong>dữ liệu mẫu</strong>. Hãy cấu hình biến môi trường Google Sheets trong
      Cloudflare Pages để đồng bộ sản phẩm thật của bạn.
    </div>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-stone-200/80 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-ink mb-2">
          Sản phẩm thủ công độc bản theo ý bạn
        </h2>
        <p class="text-stone-600 max-w-2xl text-sm md:text-base">
          Chọn mẫu bạn yêu thích, điền kích thước, màu sắc hoặc ý tưởng riêng. Xưởng sẽ tiếp nhận
          thông tin trước khi trao đổi trực tiếp qua Zalo hoặc Messenger.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-label="Bộ lọc danh mục" class="mb-6">
      <div id="category-filters" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"></div>
    </section>

    <section aria-label="Danh sách sản phẩm">
      <div
        id="product-grid"
        class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"
      >
        <p class="text-stone-500 text-sm">Đang tải sản phẩm...</p>
      </div>
      <p id="empty-state" class="hidden text-center text-stone-500 py-12">
        Không tìm thấy sản phẩm phù hợp.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-stone-200 bg-white py-6 text-center text-xs text-stone-500">
    <p>Dữ liệu đồng bộ an toàn qua Cloudflare Workers &amp; Google Sheets</p>
  </footer>

  <div
    id="product-modal"
    class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4 overflow-y-auto"
    role="dialog"
    aria-modal="true"
    aria-labelledby="modal-title"
  >
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl max-w-4xl w-full overflow-hidden shadow-xl my-auto max-h-[92vh] flex flex-col">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 border-b border-stone-100">
        <span id="modal-category" class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-500 font-medium"></span>
        <button
          id="close-modal"
          type="button"
          class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full hover:bg-stone-100 flex items-center justify-center text-stone-600"
          aria-label="Đóng"
        >
          ✕
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 overflow-y-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div>
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-stone-100 mb-3">
            <img id="modal-main-img" src="" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
          </div>
          <div id="modal-thumbs" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4"></div>
          <h3 id="modal-title" class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-1"></h3>
          <p id="modal-price" class="text-lg font-bold text-clay-700 mb-3"></p>
          <p id="modal-desc" class="text-sm text-stone-600 whitespace-pre-line leading-relaxed"></p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-cream/60 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-stone-200/70">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Gửi yêu cầu chi tiết</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-4">
            Điền thông tin để xưởng chuẩn bị tư vấn trước khi bạn nhắn Zalo / Messenger.
          </p>

          <form id="inquiry-form" class="space-y-3">
            <input id="form-product-id" name="productId" type="hidden" />
            <input id="form-product-name" name="productName" type="hidden" />

            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-stone-700 mb-1">Họ và tên *</label>
              <input
                name="customerName"
                type="text"
                required
                minlength="2"
                maxlength="80"
                placeholder="Ví dụ: Nguyễn Minh Anh"
                class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white text-sm"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-stone-700 mb-1">Số điện thoại / Zalo *</label>
              <input
                name="phoneOrZalo"
                type="tel"
                required
                minlength="8"
                maxlength="25"
                placeholder="09xx xxx xxx"
                class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white text-sm"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              <div>
                <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-stone-700 mb-1">Kích thước mong muốn</label>
                <input
                  name="dimensions"
                  type="text"
                  maxlength="120"
                  placeholder="VD: 20x30 cm"
                  class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white text-sm"
                />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-stone-700 mb-1">Số lượng</label>
                <input
                  name="quantity"
                  type="number"
                  min="1"
                  max="999"
                  value="1"
                  class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white text-sm"
                />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-stone-700 mb-1">Màu sắc / Chất liệu</label>
              <input
                name="colorOrMaterial"
                type="text"
                maxlength="120"
                placeholder="VD: Nâu bò, khắc tên..."
                class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white text-sm"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-stone-700 mb-1">Ghi chú thêm</label>
              <textarea
                name="notes"
                rows="3"
                maxlength="1000"
                placeholder="Thời gian cần nhận hàng, yêu cầu đóng gói quà..."
                class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white text-sm"
              ></textarea>
            </div>

            <div id="turnstile-container" class="pt-1"></div>

            <p id="form-error" class="hidden text-xs text-red-600 font-medium"></p>

            <button
              id="form-submit"
              type="submit"
              class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-clay-700 hover:bg-clay-600 text-white text-sm font-semibold transition disabled:opacity-60"
            >
              Gửi yêu cầu &amp; Mở chat Zalo / Messenger
            </button>
          </form>

          <div id="inquiry-success" class="hidden space-y-4">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 text-sm font-medium">
              Đã ghi nhận yêu cầu của bạn! Hãy chọn kênh chat bên dưới để trao đổi trực tiếp:
            </div>

            <pre
              id="inquiry-summary"
              class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-stone-200 text-xs text-stone-700 whitespace-pre-wrap font-sans"
            ></pre>

            <button
              id="copy-summary-btn"
              type="button"
              class="w-full py-2 px-3 rounded-xl border border-stone-300 bg-white hover:bg-stone-50 text-xs font-medium text-stone-700"
            >
              Copy nội dung yêu cầu
            </button>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5">
              <a
                id="zalo-link"
                href="#"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold text-center"
              >
                Chat qua Zalo
              </a>
              <a
                id="messenger-link"
                href="#"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold text-center"
              >
                Chat Messenger
              </a>
            </div>

            <button
              id="reset-form-btn"
              type="button"
              class="w-full text-xs text-stone-500 hover:underline pt-1"
            >
              Gửi thêm một yêu cầu khác
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="../scripts/shop.ts"></script>
</BaseLayout>
